<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 476)</h2>
<p><b>Resolve timelines full of EXR sequences open properly.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: a timeline exported from Resolve opened with only its movie clips</b> — usually just the slate, with every rendered shot silently missing. Resolve writes an image sequence as a folder plus a filename pattern rather than a single path, and Asobi only understood the single-path form.</li>
<li>A 13-clip conform that arrived as one slate now opens as all 13, each with its own frame range and rate. Folder names containing spaces are handled.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
